===Etymology===
From {{af|en|[[Mao]] <nowiki>(surname of Mao Zedong)</nowiki>|-ism}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈmaʊɪzəm/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# The [[philosophy]] espoused by [[Chinese]] leader [[w:Mao Zedong|Mao Zedong]], a form of [[Marxism-Leninism]] that focuses on the [[peasantry]] as the [[revolution]]ary [[vanguard]].
# {{rfd-sense|en}} The [[act]] or [[state]] of living in accord with the [[philosophy]] of Chairman Mao Zedong.

